{"id":"quant","lemma":"quant","pos":"adv","rank":1800,"glosses":["only used in quant à"],"ipa":"/kɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/81/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-quant.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-quant.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Quant à moi, je veux rester dehors.","en":"I want to stay outside.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to stay"},{"g":"outside"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"help!"]]},{"text":"Elle a menti quant à son âge.","en":"She lied about her age.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to lie","l":"mentir"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Soyons clairs quant à ceci !","en":"Let's be clear on this.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"clear","l":"clair"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Sois sur tes gardes quant aux pickpockets.","en":"Be on your guard against pickpockets.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"a watch, guard","l":"garde"},null,{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Quant à moi, je n'ai rien contre le plan.","en":"As for me, I have nothing against the plan.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"map"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"help!"]]}]}